{"id":"vod_sn_37364","vodId":"37364","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"抓鬼天狗帮","name_cn":"抓鬼天狗帮","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c255115a820491c2ce4727f0cfce93b8.jpg"},"summary":"民俗学者一之宫勘太郎（宫田幸季 配音）在写作之余还做起了收妖除魔的兼职，天生强大的灵感力为他的副业创造了得天独厚的条件。同勘太郎一同工作的是一只名叫妖子（川上伦子 配音）的狐妖，她因被勘太郎赋予了名字而必须服从勘太郎的所有命令。在一次意外中，勘太郎解开了“最强食鬼天狗”春华（樱井孝宏 配音）的封印，失去记忆的春华遂即成为了勘太郎得力的助手。　　杉野村发生了儿童神隐事件，唯一的幸存者也失去了记忆。勘太郎受委托调查此事，却发现这座村庄里的一切都似曾相识，并且，事件的真相似乎同春华的身世有着千丝万缕的联系。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bxGK2jhbXU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/5a6Km21shL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/G4qBuRft4F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/meyFQ8kzb41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ALnsA7fUGh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uZGeyRc9iY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qLt7bvKrJX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GbHz0J9gue1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/2aqCJTsxgc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/A7djA3GYqF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/rrY4VyLytv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tuFF8nc9fS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4e7Q7ZNKL91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bUp1Aykqab1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/2023